<title>USA: Duke, Mobil venture head expands role.</title>
<headline>Duke, Mobil venture head expands role.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duke Energy Trading and Marketing LLC, a venture 60 percent owned by Duke Energy Corp and 40 percent owned by an affiliate of Mobil Corp, said Wednesday president Donald Sinclair will become responsible for all the company's operations effective July 1.</p>
<p>The company said he is taking on the responsibilities of chairman and chief executive L.B. &quot;Buck&quot; Gatewood, who was named vice president of Duke's Energy Services Group.</p>
<p>Sinclair joined the company April 1.</p>
<p>Energy Trading and Marketing was formerly known as PanEnergy Trading and Market Services LLC prior to the recent merger between Duke Power Co and PanEnergy Corp.</p>
</text>
